[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:103. The French Test]
[00:00.660]Lesson 103. | 第103课
[00:03.465]How is the examination, Dick? | 考试怎么样，迪克？
[00:06.700]Not too bad. | 还不算太糟。
[00:08.685]I think I passed in English and Mathematics. | 我想我英语和数学都及格了。
[00:12.555]The questions were very easy. | 题目很容易。
[00:15.370]How about you, Harry? | 你呢，哈里？
[00:17.330]The English and Maths papers weren't easy enough for me. | 英语和数学对我来说不够简单。
[00:21.575]I hope I haven't failed. | 我希望我没有不及格。
[00:24.690]I think I failed the intelligence test. | 我想我智力测验不及格了。
[00:28.370]I could answer 16 of the questions. | 我能回答16道题。
[00:31.785]They were very easy. | 它们很容易。
[00:33.890]But I couldn't answer the rest. | 但我不能回答其他的。
[00:36.690]They were too difficult for me. | 它们对我来说太难了。
[00:39.220]Intelligence tests are awful, aren't they? | 智力测验太糟糕了，不是吗？
[00:42.650]I hate them. | 我讨厌它们。
[00:44.450]I'm sure I've got a low IQ. | 我肯定我的智商很低。
[00:47.115]Oh, cheer up. | 哦，振作起来。
[00:48.770]Perhaps we didn't do too badly. | 也许我们做得没那么糟。
[00:51.770]The fellow next to me wrote his name at the top of the paper. | 我旁边的那个人把他的名字写在了试卷的顶部。
[00:55.875]Yes? | 是吗？
[00:57.145]Then he sat there and looked at it for three hours. | 然后他坐在那里看了三个小时。
[01:01.615]He didn't write a word. | 他一个字也没写。